(6740866, 1008958, 124190, '<td valign="top">Something that is immediately disconcerting is the eyes.  They seem too clear and take too much from the rest of the photo. If he''s struggling so much his eyes could be bloodshot, teary or crusty or something....not like a model.  I don''t want to challenge the facial affects....who knows these could be real battle wounds....or paint splattered and Topazed to look grundgy.    His chin is a little grundgy.......just looks kinda fake or something.   clicked back and forth.  It''s definately the eyes that pop out too much.</td>', 'Something that is immediately disconcerting is the eyes.  They seem too clear and take too much from the rest of the photo. If he''s struggling so much his eyes could be bloodshot, teary or crusty or something....not like a model.  I don''t want to challenge the facial affects....who knows these could be real battle wounds....or paint splattered and Topazed to look grundgy.    His chin is a little grundgy.......just looks kinda fake or something.   clicked back and forth.  It''s definately the eyes that pop out too much.', '2012-04-13 16:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
