(6740876, 1009499, 124190, '<td valign="top">Hey Mr. bug eyes..you look like you have P&gt;T&gt;S&gt;D.......what kind of money is that?   Korean? 100 Won? looks like theres about 27 of ''em   that would be about....hmmmmm    2 and half bucks.    Yup....you need help.    What else did you see when you were over there?   Musta been horrible. 10 for possessing me until I pulled myself away.   No disrespect intended.   Haunting........</td>', 'Hey Mr. bug eyes..you look like you have P>T>S>D.......what kind of money is that?   Korean? 100 Won? looks like theres about 27 of ''em   that would be about....hmmmmm    2 and half bucks.    Yup....you need help.    What else did you see when you were over there?   Musta been horrible. 10 for possessing me until I pulled myself away.   No disrespect intended.   Haunting........', '2012-04-13 16:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6740878, 1009464, 124190, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely beautiful.   My favorite.  But I just DON''T get the grunge thing in this challenge.  I KNOW I am missing some sort of technical interpretation.   Oh well.</td>', 'This is absolutely beautiful.   My favorite.  But I just DON''T get the grunge thing in this challenge.  I KNOW I am missing some sort of technical interpretation.   Oh well.', '2012-04-13 16:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6740882, 1009478, 124190, '<td valign="top">I like this for several reasons.   It doesn''t look staged. The windshield wiper lines make it cohesive and create a wonderful texture along with the lighting on the driver and dash.   First I thought it was a gun and felt kinda frightened....but now realize it''s a screwdriver and sunglasses....does that make him trustworthy?   I can almost smell his dirty old seats.....lol   10</td>', 'I like this for several reasons.   It doesn''t look staged. The windshield wiper lines make it cohesive and create a wonderful texture along with the lighting on the driver and dash.   First I thought it was a gun and felt kinda frightened....but now realize it''s a screwdriver and sunglasses....does that make him trustworthy?   I can almost smell his dirty old seats.....lol   10', '2012-04-13 16:40:47.000000', NULL, 1);
