(6742431, 1009423, 86447, '<td valign="top">The frame isn''t working for me... and I wish the beak were in focus, but... I love the focus on his/her eyes and that POP of red!<br/> <br/> <br/>(commenting only)</td>', 'The frame isn''t working for me... and I wish the beak were in focus, but... I love the focus on his/her eyes and that POP of red!  (commenting only)', '2012-04-15 19:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742433, 1009639, 86447, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image!<br/> <br/>Not sure yet... if it''s really "grungy"... but I love the image.<br/> <br/> <br/>(commenting only)</td>', 'Wonderful image! Not sure yet... if it''s really "grungy"... but I love the image.  (commenting only)', '2012-04-15 19:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742486, 1009568, 10848, '<td valign="top">WOW very impressive, excellent editing and creativity. 10</td>', 'WOW very impressive, excellent editing and creativity. 10', '2012-04-15 21:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742488, 1009467, 10848, '<td valign="top">Very nice, nostalgic appearance.</td>', 'Very nice, nostalgic appearance.', '2012-04-15 21:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742502, 1009596, 142816, '<td valign="top">delicate and eery...one of my favorites in this challenge</td>', 'delicate and eery...one of my favorites in this challenge', '2012-04-15 21:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742504, 1009638, 142816, '<td valign="top">I like the old feel to this, and the simple graphic elements.  Oh, and the colors.</td>', 'I like the old feel to this, and the simple graphic elements.  Oh, and the colors.', '2012-04-15 21:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742505, 1009598, 142816, '<td valign="top">such attention to details, really enjoy this</td>', 'such attention to details, really enjoy this', '2012-04-15 21:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742506, 1008828, 142816, '<td valign="top">wow</td>', 'wow', '2012-04-15 21:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742508, 1009601, 142816, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful.  Love the PP.</td>', 'Very beautiful.  Love the PP.', '2012-04-15 21:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742509, 1009543, 142816, '<td valign="top">I''m laughing...</td>', 'I''m laughing...', '2012-04-15 21:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742516, 1009423, 142816, '<td valign="top">This is disturbing and confusing.  Nice!</td>', 'This is disturbing and confusing.  Nice!', '2012-04-15 21:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742518, 1009187, 128323, '<td valign="top">Wow, I think you nailed this genre!  10</td>', 'Wow, I think you nailed this genre!  10', '2012-04-15 21:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742536, 1009368, 30982, '<td valign="top">Not quite my definition of grunge.  Odd, yes, but grunge - not exactly.  It does make me wonder why he has a toy snake around his neck, though.</td>', 'Not quite my definition of grunge.  Odd, yes, but grunge - not exactly.  It does make me wonder why he has a toy snake around his neck, though.', '2012-04-15 22:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742537, 1009473, 30982, '<td valign="top">The picture kind of lacks substance to me - it''s the bed of a truck with a bit of an overlay, but if there''s more to the story it doesn''t quite make it through.  I kind of see a misty ocean in the distance with perhaps a road?  I suspect if this is the story you wanted to tell, that less of the truck bed and more of the ocean would have made it easier to see.</td>', 'The picture kind of lacks substance to me - it''s the bed of a truck with a bit of an overlay, but if there''s more to the story it doesn''t quite make it through.  I kind of see a misty ocean in the distance with perhaps a road?  I suspect if this is the story you wanted to tell, that less of the truck bed and more of the ocean would have made it easier to see.', '2012-04-15 22:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742538, 1009293, 30982, '<td valign="top">The flower doesn''t look particularly grungy to me - more of a slight acid treatment perhaps?  The fold is interesting, though I''m not quite sure what you were going for with that.  A book, or a mirror, perhaps?</td>', 'The flower doesn''t look particularly grungy to me - more of a slight acid treatment perhaps?  The fold is interesting, though I''m not quite sure what you were going for with that.  A book, or a mirror, perhaps?', '2012-04-15 22:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742539, 1009382, 30982, '<td valign="top">The lighting here comes across as very flat.  I suspect a good kick in levels and or brightness would bring this to life a bit more.  While the building itself looks a bit worn, it probably isn''t grungy enough for this challenge.</td>', 'The lighting here comes across as very flat.  I suspect a good kick in levels and or brightness would bring this to life a bit more.  While the building itself looks a bit worn, it probably isn''t grungy enough for this challenge.', '2012-04-15 22:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742540, 1008818, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the vastness of this, but am not sure I see the "grunge" of it - looks like a normal, lovely gray sky to me!</td>', 'I like the vastness of this, but am not sure I see the "grunge" of it - looks like a normal, lovely gray sky to me!', '2012-04-15 22:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742543, 1009535, 30982, '<td valign="top">You do realize it is entirely unfair when you are so very photogenic to begin with.  The overlay of the grasses provides a nice frame (albeit not particularly enlightening in meaning, perhaps) and the grunge/texture is done with a nice light touch.  It is, of course, the base portrait which serves this so very well.</td>', 'You do realize it is entirely unfair when you are so very photogenic to begin with.  The overlay of the grasses provides a nice frame (albeit not particularly enlightening in meaning, perhaps) and the grunge/texture is done with a nice light touch.  It is, of course, the base portrait which serves this so very well.', '2012-04-15 22:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742546, 1008672, 30982, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites.  A very good use of grunge/texture/motion to create energy - a feeling of movement, going somewhere.  Nicely done.</td>', 'One of my favorites.  A very good use of grunge/texture/motion to create energy - a feeling of movement, going somewhere.  Nicely done.', '2012-04-15 22:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742547, 1009464, 30982, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a bit too processed for some, but I like the frenetic chaos created.</td>', 'Perhaps a bit too processed for some, but I like the frenetic chaos created.', '2012-04-15 22:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742548, 1009604, 30982, '<td valign="top">Strange, poignant, perhaps a bit on the unnerving side.  Very nicely done with the text as the overlay.</td>', 'Strange, poignant, perhaps a bit on the unnerving side.  Very nicely done with the text as the overlay.', '2012-04-15 22:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742552, 1008828, 30982, '<td valign="top">A bit characteristic of the Instagram genre, and very effective.  The femme fatale fleeing the scene.  Well done.</td>', 'A bit characteristic of the Instagram genre, and very effective.  The femme fatale fleeing the scene.  Well done.', '2012-04-15 22:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742553, 1009476, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oddly compelling!  Great use of the muted color scheme and grungy texture overlay.</td>', 'Oddly compelling!  Great use of the muted color scheme and grungy texture overlay.', '2012-04-15 22:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742554, 1009616, 30982, '<td valign="top">Intriguing symbolism with very good base shots, particularly the crow.  Love the eyes on both, and nice choice of the overlays.</td>', 'Intriguing symbolism with very good base shots, particularly the crow.  Love the eyes on both, and nice choice of the overlays.', '2012-04-15 22:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742558, 1009054, 28742, '<td valign="top">FANTASTIC!</td>', 'FANTASTIC!', '2012-04-15 22:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742580, 1009590, 30982, '<td valign="top">Brings back memories of summers when we traveled cross country to visit relatives during the school break.  Miles on end by car, but I remember it fondly - we enjoyed those trips.  Thanks for reminding me.</td>', 'Brings back memories of summers when we traveled cross country to visit relatives during the school break.  Miles on end by car, but I remember it fondly - we enjoyed those trips.  Thanks for reminding me.', '2012-04-15 23:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742582, 1008711, 30982, '<td valign="top">An odd collection of images and objects.  The tape dispenser features prominently (and I used to have an office chair just like that!)  I want to see more of the poem and the tree, for it figures prominently in the story, but not being able to see it adds the the mystery and oddity.  Very well done.</td>', 'An odd collection of images and objects.  The tape dispenser features prominently (and I used to have an office chair just like that!)  I want to see more of the poem and the tree, for it figures prominently in the story, but not being able to see it adds the the mystery and oddity.  Very well done.', '2012-04-15 23:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742584, 1009596, 30982, '<td valign="top">Almost a memory, with just the right amount of cobwebs to create that feel.</td>', 'Almost a memory, with just the right amount of cobwebs to create that feel.', '2012-04-15 23:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742593, 1009568, 30982, '<td valign="top">Probably more surreal than grunge but oh how I can relate to the subject matter.  Sadly, I don''t believe there is a key that fits, and yet we all still continue to search, don''t we?  Awesome sky, by the way, and a pretty nifty staircase as well.</td>', 'Probably more surreal than grunge but oh how I can relate to the subject matter.  Sadly, I don''t believe there is a key that fits, and yet we all still continue to search, don''t we?  Awesome sky, by the way, and a pretty nifty staircase as well.', '2012-04-15 23:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742595, 1009161, 10785, '<td valign="top">You chose a nice shooting angle for this but I think the composition suffers a bit form lack of a more defined foreground. You only have the two layers which is the subject in the foreground and the sky/treeline in the background. It does seem a little dark and grey overall which is probably what you were going for in this challenge. The scene is lacking in contrast which is due to the overcast sky and the lack of shadow.</td>', 'You chose a nice shooting angle for this but I think the composition suffers a bit form lack of a more defined foreground. You only have the two layers which is the subject in the foreground and the sky/treeline in the background. It does seem a little dark and grey overall which is probably what you were going for in this challenge. The scene is lacking in contrast which is due to the overcast sky and the lack of shadow.', '2012-04-15 23:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742596, 1009631, 10785, '<td valign="top">You got the dark shot and a rugged subject for that grunge look, but what brings this down for me is in the processing. You didn''t really get and texture shown. What you got was a lot of noise grain. Also the fringing from the extreme HDR needs to be taken care of in post. There are nice tutorials out there to get that done.</td>', 'You got the dark shot and a rugged subject for that grunge look, but what brings this down for me is in the processing. You didn''t really get and texture shown. What you got was a lot of noise grain. Also the fringing from the extreme HDR needs to be taken care of in post. There are nice tutorials out there to get that done.', '2012-04-15 23:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742597, 1009656, 10785, '<td valign="top">Just a little too simple here in my opinion. Nothing is defined and there is no real subject. Somewhat abstract, the photo does lack any textures or other indicators to help it link to your title of matallurgy.</td>', 'Just a little too simple here in my opinion. Nothing is defined and there is no real subject. Somewhat abstract, the photo does lack any textures or other indicators to help it link to your title of matallurgy.', '2012-04-15 23:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742598, 1009423, 30982, '<td valign="top">What an odd looking bird, though I don''t know that I''d consider him "grungy".  Mostly just odd!  The framing isn''t helping you as far as DPC voting goes, I don''t think.</td>', 'What an odd looking bird, though I don''t know that I''d consider him "grungy".  Mostly just odd!  The framing isn''t helping you as far as DPC voting goes, I don''t think.', '2012-04-15 23:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742599, 1009594, 10785, '<td valign="top">Great shape and I do like the processing. You showed the metal pipe well with the reflected light enhancing the shine. The clouds were really over sharpened here as there appears to be some jpg artifacting. They look a little unnatural as I have never seen clouds so jagged before. Keeping the sky masked in your sharpening process could have helped.</td>', 'Great shape and I do like the processing. You showed the metal pipe well with the reflected light enhancing the shine. The clouds were really over sharpened here as there appears to be some jpg artifacting. They look a little unnatural as I have never seen clouds so jagged before. Keeping the sky masked in your sharpening process could have helped.', '2012-04-15 23:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742600, 1009612, 30982, '<td valign="top">A pretty good street shot - I like plaid shirt echoed by the shadows of the fence - a sort of plaid pattern on the ground.  I also like the hand going by but not apparently dropping anything in the glass.  Not sure this will register as "grunge", though.  Gritty, as it street, yes, but not particularly grunge.</td>', 'A pretty good street shot - I like plaid shirt echoed by the shadows of the fence - a sort of plaid pattern on the ground.  I also like the hand going by but not apparently dropping anything in the glass.  Not sure this will register as "grunge", though.  Gritty, as it street, yes, but not particularly grunge.', '2012-04-15 23:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742601, 1008963, 30982, '<td valign="top">That thing''s been there awhile!  The processing ins''t to my taste - a bit too sharp throughout to the point it seems "crunchy" (which is not a technical term).  I think maybe had you left more color, it would have made the bus stand out a bit more?</td>', 'That thing''s been there awhile!  The processing ins''t to my taste - a bit too sharp throughout to the point it seems "crunchy" (which is not a technical term).  I think maybe had you left more color, it would have made the bus stand out a bit more?', '2012-04-15 23:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742602, 1009594, 30982, '<td valign="top">You''ve got me wonering just what the heck the purpose of this particular piping structure is... But I do think the shot is too "clean" to rate very high on the "grunge" scale.  Definitely mind-boggling, though!</td>', 'You''ve got me wonering just what the heck the purpose of this particular piping structure is... But I do think the shot is too "clean" to rate very high on the "grunge" scale.  Definitely mind-boggling, though!', '2012-04-15 23:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742603, 1009128, 30982, '<td valign="top">Strikes me more as HDR on steroids than grunge, although I think one could argue HDR is kinda grungy.  WAY cool set of stairs, though!</td>', 'Strikes me more as HDR on steroids than grunge, although I think one could argue HDR is kinda grungy.  WAY cool set of stairs, though!', '2012-04-15 23:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742604, 1009161, 30982, '<td valign="top">Strikes me more as HDR, perhaps, than grunge, but I think some would argue HDR *is* grunge!   I like the shot - this place has definitely seen better days!</td>', 'Strikes me more as HDR, perhaps, than grunge, but I think some would argue HDR *is* grunge!   I like the shot - this place has definitely seen better days!', '2012-04-15 23:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742606, 1009601, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the depth of field.  And the processing suits this well - has almost a sci-fi/pseudo horror movie kinda thing going on.</td>', 'I like the depth of field.  And the processing suits this well - has almost a sci-fi/pseudo horror movie kinda thing going on.', '2012-04-15 23:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742607, 1009562, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very odd, very grungy.  And just a wee bit disturbing!</td>', 'Very odd, very grungy.  And just a wee bit disturbing!', '2012-04-15 23:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742608, 1009543, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the oddness of the chicken.  Add to that the etchings on the bamboo and you have the potential for a very strange short story.</td>', 'I like the oddness of the chicken.  Add to that the etchings on the bamboo and you have the potential for a very strange short story.', '2012-04-15 23:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
