(6742618, 1009187, 30982, '<td valign="top">To me, this works very well as "grunge" - the texture to the sky enhances and adds, well, texture!  The tones work very well, too.  Would make a great card.</td>', 'To me, this works very well as "grunge" - the texture to the sky enhances and adds, well, texture!  The tones work very well, too.  Would make a great card.', '2012-04-15 23:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
