(6742629, 1009371, 30982, '<td valign="top">I really like how some of the characters seem almost suspended and/or moving into the cartoon world from the real.  The guy in the white t-shirt seems the most real, the anchor if you will.  Not sure you need all of the bottom of the shot - give us a bit more of the surreal world above.  Nice title, too.</td>', 'I really like how some of the characters seem almost suspended and/or moving into the cartoon world from the real.  The guy in the white t-shirt seems the most real, the anchor if you will.  Not sure you need all of the bottom of the shot - give us a bit more of the surreal world above.  Nice title, too.', '2012-04-15 23:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
