(6746514, 1009451, 7778, '<td valign="top">the crow flies close to the margin.<br/>there''s too much of too little in the fore.<br/>it is the postindustrial age, the wheel squared<br/> <br/>come unhinged in the chaos. Corrosion<br/>forges the monument. The white<br/> <br/>cloud, twisted and blown from soot<br/>undulates, making black over blue<br/> <br/>and hangs there, a swath..</td>', 'the crow flies close to the margin.there''s too much of too little in the fore.it is the postindustrial age, the wheel squared come unhinged in the chaos. Corrosionforges the monument. The white cloud, twisted and blown from sootundulates, making black over blue and hangs there, a swath..', '2012-04-19 18:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
