(6749062, 1009598, 16912, '<td valign="top">Debs Debs Debs! I looked at this image for ages and it had ''something'' I couldn''t quite put my finger on. I loved it and thought the ''grunge'' worked really well and now i know what ''it'' was - YOU! That said, it was a long time ago we met in London so forgive me ;)<br/> <br/>Whilst I love your pigeons I do think you should dump them for a while and do a set of SP''s, this is wonderful!</td>', 'Debs Debs Debs! I looked at this image for ages and it had ''something'' I couldn''t quite put my finger on. I loved it and thought the ''grunge'' worked really well and now i know what ''it'' was - YOU! That said, it was a long time ago we met in London so forgive me ;) Whilst I love your pigeons I do think you should dump them for a while and do a set of SP''s, this is wonderful!', '2012-04-22 20:09:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(6749569, 1009641, 142615, '<td valign="top">Congratulations</td>', 'Congratulations', '2012-04-23 09:55:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(6749640, 1008906, 138253, '<td valign="top">I think that while the overgrowth in front of the school can add to it''s age and state of disrepair, it doesn''t mean it makes it an overly grungy feeling shot. The lighting seems to bee too bright (check the roof), even in the false tones to convey a sense of a dark/brooding/grimy place.<br/>I think if you had shot this with a longer exposure closer to dusk it would''ve felt creepier.<br/>1/100 speed means you had a good amount of ambient light here to get this shot from this distance, that is evident in the roof and windows.</td>', 'I think that while the overgrowth in front of the school can add to it''s age and state of disrepair, it doesn''t mean it makes it an overly grungy feeling shot. The lighting seems to bee too bright (check the roof), even in the false tones to convey a sense of a dark/brooding/grimy place.I think if you had shot this with a longer exposure closer to dusk it would''ve felt creepier.1/100 speed means you had a good amount of ambient light here to get this shot from this distance, that is evident in the roof and windows.', '2012-04-23 11:59:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(6749669, 1008906, 49954, '<td valign="top">I scored this a 6... I love old school photography of old schools (grin)... I think the sky could have used some special attention as it, to me looked dithered more than grunge.</td>', 'I scored this a 6... I love old school photography of old schools (grin)... I think the sky could have used some special attention as it, to me looked dithered more than grunge.', '2012-04-23 12:18:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(6749694, 1008906, 96751, '<td valign="top">The photo itself is really good, just doesn''t say grunge to me.  And the tilt is too subtle. If you''re going to use one, go for it! Right now it looks more like a mistake.</td>', 'The photo itself is really good, just doesn''t say grunge to me.  And the tilt is too subtle. If you''re going to use one, go for it! Right now it looks more like a mistake.', '2012-04-23 12:45:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(6749733, 1009598, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh Wow!  I missed this after the challenge, but came to check it out after your amazing finish in the head challenge.  I sooo agree with Ecce Signum about diverting from the pigeons to do more of this type of photography... you are an ARTIST!  And methinks, this is your niche!  Congratulations, Ms. Heavyweight!  :)</td>', 'Oh Wow!  I missed this after the challenge, but came to check it out after your amazing finish in the head challenge.  I sooo agree with Ecce Signum about diverting from the pigeons to do more of this type of photography... you are an ARTIST!  And methinks, this is your niche!  Congratulations, Ms. Heavyweight!  :)', '2012-04-23 13:16:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(6749825, 1009054, 3936, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Stunning!  I sit here looking at it, and still find it hard to comprehend all that was done to achieve this.  Congratulations on a very, very well deserved blue!</td>', 'Wow!  Stunning!  I sit here looking at it, and still find it hard to comprehend all that was done to achieve this.  Congratulations on a very, very well deserved blue!', '2012-04-23 16:17:42.000000', NULL, 0),
