(6778282, 1009371, 16148, '<td valign="top">I came back to study this image again.  I''ve learned a lot from your work, not that it shows in my images.  The boy wearing a yellow shirt, who appears to be walking on the handrail, pulls this image together IMO.  I think size restrictions and limited time spent voting hurt this image.  We are really only voting on thumbnails.  You''re work often requires more time to pull together and fully appreciate.</td>', 'I came back to study this image again.  I''ve learned a lot from your work, not that it shows in my images.  The boy wearing a yellow shirt, who appears to be walking on the handrail, pulls this image together IMO.  I think size restrictions and limited time spent voting hurt this image.  We are really only voting on thumbnails.  You''re work often requires more time to pull together and fully appreciate.', '2012-05-25 13:15:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(6796037, 1009468, 28710, '<td valign="top">AWESOMESAUCE!<br/> <br/>It''s not just the lighting, it''s also the [Jack Black deranged grungeo voice + heavy distortion]LIGHTING[/Jack Black deranged grungeo voice + heavy distortion]<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-06-15 10:48:37.</i></td>', 'AWESOMESAUCE! It''s not just the lighting, it''s also the [Jack Black deranged grungeo voice + heavy distortion]LIGHTING[/Jack Black deranged grungeo voice + heavy distortion]', '2012-06-15 11:47:49.000000', '2012-06-15 11:48:37.000000', 0),
(6796111, 1009375, 28710, '<td valign="top">Excellent! I can''t see the detail of the writing on the gravestone, but it certainly shows its age. I think the most important thing in this for me is that the grave cover seems to have been damaged.<br/> <br/>Being as the Corpse Bride is one of my favorites of all times, my imagination had all kinds of fun with this little 800 pixel wide story.</td>', 'Excellent! I can''t see the detail of the writing on the gravestone, but it certainly shows its age. I think the most important thing in this for me is that the grave cover seems to have been damaged. Being as the Corpse Bride is one of my favorites of all times, my imagination had all kinds of fun with this little 800 pixel wide story.', '2012-06-15 13:05:57.000000', NULL, 0),
